<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This profile does make super boost flight by ultimate and packet
Raze profile keybinds: Attack (it may be second attack keybind) (I)
Bomb packet (U)
If it doesnt work try to change delay between keys (from 10  to 150 ms. possibly)</Description>
    <Comment>You should use ultimate and place packet before using it. </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 24 1
KeyUp 24 1
Delay 100 ms
KeyDown 12 1
KeyUp 12 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Valorant</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>